{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S07\",\"screen\":\"他觉得对方有时也需要他\",\"source\":\"他渐渐觉得，也许对方有时也需要他陪着\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿用“也许”保留了猜测，屏幕稿删去这一层不确定，语气变得更肯定。\"},{\"sec\":\"S07\",\"screen\":\"想到这里心里忽然一紧，却还是想这样待着\",\"source\":\"他高兴得有点收不住，想到两个人也许能互相依靠，心里忽然一紧，却还想这样待着。\",\"type\":\"7\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿中心里一紧发生在想到互相依靠之后、盼望未来陪伴之前；屏幕稿将这份反应移到了盼望未来陪伴之后，改变了情绪推进的顺序。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "43f07a28-1bd9-4a49-901f-ac696202b66d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T223648867413Z", "elapsed_seconds": 326.312, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T22:42:15.199898+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "83c6f342455499b7051ac795e06e798abed20c5b38fbc774b79f62d3a4a6a405", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6